+ * GIC-400 (GICv2) — MSM8953
+ * ========================================================================
+ *
+ * Absolute physical addresses (mainline qcom/msm8953.dtsi):
+ *   GICD (distributor)      0x0B000000  0x1000
+ *   GICC (CPU interface)    0x0B002000  0x2000
